 r←Reject req;json;payload
⍝ Build the 401 envelope for a request that failed authentication.
⍝ Jarvis converts a payload to JSON only for requests that reach a handler
⍝ so this payload is serialised here and sent verbatim
⍝ JSON sanitisation copied from Jarvis
⍝ req: Jarvis request object    :: namespace reference
⍝   r: Jarvis auth result       :: 1, meaning unauthorized
 payload←(error:401 ⋄ message:'Missing or invalid X-API-Key header')
 payload.request←(method:req.Method ⋄ endpoint:req.Endpoint)
⍝ Pre-routing, so QueryParams is still Jarvis's name/value matrix, not Stark's namespace
 payload.query_parameters←{0::⎕JSON'{}' ⋄ ()⎕VSET↓⍵}req.QueryParams
 json←∊{127<c←⎕UCS ⍵:'\u','0123456789ABCDEF'[1+16 16 16 16⊤c] ⋄ ⍵}¨1 ⎕JSON payload
 'content-type'req.SetHeader'application/json'
 req.Response.Payload←⎕UCS json
 r←1
